{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"736709568389709834","content":"Leaf and Thumper both quietly walk into the temple. Leaf sits on the ground against the wall and looks to Thumper. He sits up in front of her and twitches his nose. \"Well I don't know either budy, but people seem to think I know things somehow, so I feel like I should post a notice too.\" Thumper taps the ground a few times with his foot. \"If he does something bad? I don't know. Knowing myself I'd probably feel responsible. But I also know I shouldn't-\" Thumper interrupts her by burrowing into her pocket and producing her calligrapher's pen. She sighs \"You're right. Put things on paper and see how they look.\" She pulls out some paper and starts writing.","created_at":"2020-08-21T06:58:27.129000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746261922202255361","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
