{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736709568389709834","content":"Copper walks inside, he finds a private place to sit down on his knees. \nHe closes his eyes and prays.\n“There is so much I wish to say, but so little time. In all honesty, I don’t know who to thank for bringing me here to this place. To all these amazing adventures I’ve had. To all these people I’m proud to call my friends. So much has happened in just these few short months, however I know the worst is yet to come. My friends and I, are about to take on a difficult task. One that even got the better of some of you. I don’t say that out of disrespect, just trying to put into perspective what it is we are about to do. So I’d like to pray to a few specific gods who have helped us on this journey so far.\nTo Melora, I pray for your wisdom and your kindness. You have shown me much joy, and shown me how to forgive people. I thank you, and I ask you be with us in this fight.\nTo the Raven Queen, I pray for your continued Protection. You have given us a great gift. Lilia. Without her this battle would probably be much more difficult. I pray for your continued protection of her, and of us. We will need it.\nTo Bahamut, the creator of my people. Without you, my very being would not be here. I thank you for the life I have been given, and that I’ve been able to dedicate it to the betterment of others. Please, I hope you will regain your power soon, and be able to assist us in this fight.\nAnd to all other gods who have watched over us, and I just didn’t notice. Thank you. Thank you all. I pray to each and everyone of you. Please, guide us.”\nCopper takes a deep breath, “I beg you. Please. Give me the chance. Just a chance. To help protect everyone here.”\nCopper can’t help but laugh, “maybe I should pray to the god of Luck or Gambling. I feel like when asking for a chance, it’d be best to ask him.” \nCopper sighs, “well, if any of you are listening. Thank you.”","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:33:20.288000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746512293457559556","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
